      "body": "Friendly ping — this one is blocked on CI rather than on review.\n\n`pr-gate` requires the `run-ci` label, which needs write access, so the checks can't run on my end. Could a maintainer add it?\n\nRe-verified against current `main` before pinging: the blocking `requests.get` is still there in the async `remote_instance_transfer_engine_info` route (now around line 1301 — the route picked up an `@auth_level` decorator and a deprecated alias since I opened this, but the call itself is unchanged). The patch still applies cleanly and `asyncio` is already imported at the top of the module, so the diff stays at +2/-1.\n\nHappy to rebase or close it if you'd rather solve it differently.",
